 "name": "ST51EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "Hayato",
  "\"The Luo Company got hold of",
  " this map of the Titans' layout",
  " in New Guinea.\"",
  "Amuro",
  "\"It's still under construction.\"",
  "\"Against forces like these,",
  " even we alone",
  " can hit them hard enough.\"",
  "Karaba Soldier",
  "\"Captain Hayato!",
  " Message coming in",
  " from New Hong Kong!\"",
  "\"From the Luo Company?\"",
  "\"Yes, sir. Decoding now...\"",
  "\"From 11:00 today, for 24 hours,",
  " the Argama will hold its course",
  " in satellite orbit.\"",
  "\"The Argama's coming...!?\"",
  "\"That's too soon...",
  " We won't reach New Guinea",
  " until tomorrow morning at best.\"",
  "\"We have to make it.",
  " A chance like this won't",
  " come around again and again.\"",
  "The Audhumla was on course",
  "to strike the Titans'",
  "New Guinea base.",
  "The Titans were massing forces",
  "at Gryps,",
  "and it was obvious that this was",
  "to keep Granada, the AEUG's base,",
  "in check.",
  "Ahead of the Earth Federation",
  "government's annual assembly,",
  "the plan was to show off",
  "the might of the Titans.",
  "Before that could happen,",
  "a strike on New Guinea",
  "would raise the AEUG's profile",
  "and throw the Titans,",
  "whose base was on Earth,",
  "into disarray.",
  "For if Earth was at the mercy",
  "of the AEUG and Karaba,",
  "swaggering in space",
  "about Gryps",
  "could never",
  "carry any conviction.",
  "Unlike the One Year War, by then",
  "the whole Earth Sphere was not",
  "blanketed in combat-density",
  "Minovsky particles.",
  "Not to old-century levels,",
  "but computer networks",
  "and TV news networks",
  "were rapidly recovering.",
  "So propaganda could count for",
  "more than in the One Year War.",
  "\"A small elite force\"",
  "may sound nice,",
  "but for those with almost",
  "no real fighting strength,",
  "winning public opinion",
  "was nothing less than essential.",
  "Yet at the same time,",
  "neglecting space",
  "was out of the question.",
  "The Mk-II,",
  "and a boy named Kamille",
  "who might be a Newtype:",
  "returning them to the AEUG's",
  "main force,",
  "it was thought, had",
  "strategic significance.",
  "That was because even people",
  "like Amuro and Hayato",
  "wanted to wager on Kamille's",
  "potential as a Newtype--",
  "a feeling that lay somewhere",
  "in their hearts, perhaps.",
  "That, as Amuro once had,",
  "he might cut a clean, bright path",
  "through the darkness of the age:",
  "such was their hope.",
  "Of course, Amuro and Hayato",
  "both knew that it was Amuro's",
  "tireless effort that made it so,",
  "and so",
  "they never forgot",
  "to support Kamille.",
  "At heart,",
  "they had become good adults.",
  "This, I would like to think,",
  "was a seed that those who fell",
  "in that war--Ramba Ral,",
  "Matilda Ajan,",
  "and other grown-ups like them--",
  "managed to leave",
  "to the world.",
  "Otherwise, it would be too sad.",
  "The Road to Flight",
  "Kamille's Feelings",
  "Beltorchika",
  "\"Want to come to my room?",
  " I've got hot coffee.\"",
  "\"Sorry... Beltorchika.\"",
  "\"Come on...!\"",
  "\"Beltorchika. I'm sorry.\"",
  "\"You're all fierce and glinting,",
  " just like a sword...\"",
  "\"Huh...?\"",
  "\"You're",
  " not like Lieutenant Quattro.\"",
  "\"You're not someone who gets",
  " so wrapped up in fighting.\"",
  "\"You're being realistic,",
  " starting to accept the fighting,",
  " and you're telling me that?\"",
  "\"What I want from you",
  " is something else.\"",
  "\"You're Amuro Ray.",
  " Not Lieutenant Quattro.\"",
  "\"But in a situation like this,",
  " there aren't many choices.\"",
  "\"What must I do, as a human...\"",
  "\"Lieutenant Quattro",
  " didn't hesitate,",
  " but I was too much of a coward...\"",
  "\"That's only normal.",
  " Do you think I joined",
  " Karaba just like that?\"",
  "\"...I already know",
  " what I have to do.\"",
  "\"Whatever it takes, I'll send Kamille",
  " back to space.",
  " I promised Lieutenant Quattro.\"",
  "\"...! Amuro!\"",
  "\"It's you who wants",
  " to go back to space, isn't it?\"",
  "\"...Space",
  " will let Kamille's potential",
  " grow without limit...\"",
  "\"And if, as a result, that has",
  " a good effect on me...",
  " that alone is enough.\"",
  "\"So you're using Kamille!\"",
  "\"That's not it.",
  " Awakening as a Newtype",
  " isn't Kamille's problem alone.\"",
  "\"It's a problem for all humanity,",
  " me included.\"",
  "\"...What a big dream, Amuro...\"",
  "\"It's not a dream. It's reality.",
  " That's what I'm working for.\"",
  "\"Ah...\"",
  "In Amuro's words",
  "there was no lie, no pretense.",
  "Newtype or not, he is known",
  "as a man who was always kind",
  "to those who came after him.",
  "In that, he was unlike Char,",
  "a charming but selfish superior.",
  "The One Year War and seven years",
  "of confinement had given Amuro",
  "a consideration beyond his years.",
  "Of course, even Amuro hardly",
  "imagined humanity one day",
  "suddenly going Newtype--pop!--",
  "all awakening at once in some",
  "carefree vision of the future.",
  "But at least, the bitter setback",
  "he had once known as a boy",
  "was one he wished to spare Kamille;",
  "of that much we can be sure.",
  "And",
  "it is also a fact that meeting",
  "a boy called Kamille",
  "and a woman called Beltorchika",
  "began to change Amuro Ray.",
  "What Amuro went on to do on Earth",
  "is told in many versions,",
  "and at times",
  "there are even tales",
  "straight out of a hero anime,",
  "but I want to believe such rumors",
  "spread because he was on his way",
  "to a healthy rebirth.",
  "By caring for others,",
  "Amuro was finding that he, too,",
  "could be healed.",
  "\"Kamille!",
  " Kamille, I have a favor to ask!\"",
  "Kamille",
  "\"Of me?\"",
  "\"You",
  " like Amuro, don't you?\"",
  "\"You're beating around the bush.",
  " What do you mean?\"",
  "\"I don't want Amuro",
  " to be near you.\"",
  "\"When he's near you,",
  " Amuro pushes himself too hard.\"",
  "\"And if he does,",
  " Amuro will die young...\"",
  "To Beltorchika,",
  "it seemed that Amuro",
  "was projecting himself onto Kamille",
  "too much, and perhaps wished",
  "to die.",
  "Even if her kiss",
  "had brought Amuro back to life,",
  "the idea of him resting content",
  "with his head in her lap alone",
  "was simply impossible.",
  "That was what",
  "so badly frustrated Beltorchika.",
  "She too was a child forced",
  "by the times to be an adult,",
  "and was acting like one.",
  "\"...! You mean I'm",
  " not strong enough?\"",
  "\"That's not it!\"",
  "\"Yes, it is!",
  " You just said so!\"",
  "\"What I'm saying is,",
  " with you, Kamille, Amuro",
  " pushes himself too hard.\"",
  "\"Then all the more,",
  " it's not my problem.\"",
  "\"You'll just have to ask",
  " Amuro-san to be",
  " careful, won't you?\"",
  "\"Is he the type to listen?\"",
  "\"He's so serious, that man...\"",
  "\"That's why!",
  " I want you to think",
  " about what to do!\"",
  "\"There's no way I could",
  " do anything about it!\"",
  "\"We're under fire!",
  " Mobile suits, prepare to launch!\"",
  "\"Gotta go!\"",
  "\"Promise me!",
  " That you'll give Amuro back!\"",
  "\"That's a woman's selfishness!\"",
  "\"Just remember,",
  " things like that can",
  " get a man killed!\"",
  "\"Kamille!\"",
  "\"...A woman's selfishness",
  " gets a man killed...?",
  " Kamille...\"",
  "Ahead of the rendezvous,",
  "the Sudori's unit",
  "caught up with the Audhumla.",
  "If the Audhumla made it",
  "to New Guinea,",
  "the credit for crushing the AEUG",
  "would go to the regular",
  "Titans.",
  "For the Sudori unit,",
  "a patchwork outfit,",
  "that was the one thing",
  "it had to avoid.",
  "With the Titans tightening",
  "their grip on the government,",
  "they could ill afford to be shelved",
  "as incompetents.",
  "\"No word from the Argama yet?\"",
  "Comms Officer",
  "\"It's due any moment...",
  " but the static is terrible...\"",
  "\"Even if the Argama comes,",
  " there's no shuttle.\"",
  "\"Amuro...\"",
  "\"...A chance like this,",
  " and we just let it slip...\"",
  "But heedless of Amuro's",
  "impatience,",
  "the mobile suit battle",
  "kept spreading",
  "until it filled the entire view.",
  "And among it all",
  "could be seen",
  "Four's Psycho Gundam.",
  "\"...Four!?",
  " What's wrong!",
  " Are you hurt!?\"",
  "Four",
  "\"...Kamille!",
  " ...Ngh...!\"",
  "\"Kamille! You can launch, right!\"",
  "\"Believe that the Argama",
  " will pick you up.\"",
  "\"I can correct my course...",
  " but will the Argama be all right!?\"",
  "\"Kamille...! To space!\"",
  "\"Good... bye...\""
 ]
}
